# Dependencies and generated build output (all workspace levels).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.cache
**/.pnpm-store
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/.venv-*
**/venv

# Local configuration: examples are not required to compile.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.aws
**/.ssh
**/.codex
**/.agents
**/*.private.*
**/private
**/credentials
**/credentials.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx

# Local state, documents, backups and evidence are not build inputs.
**/.git
**/.idea
**/.vscode
/tmp
/temp
**/storage
**/backups
**/evidencias
**/evidence
**/evidence-*
**/*.bak
**/*.orig
**/*.rej
**/*.log
**/*.dump
**/*~
**/.DS_Store

